x":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"生日宴会什么的最烦人了，我要取消！今天我是来收债的，你...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"document:11:551:0":{"key":"document:11:551:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"本人，秘银商会罗万在此郑重承诺：\n因在今日的“皇家至尊无敌超级纸牌大赛”中，不幸（且极有可能是被针对地）败给了佩吉公主。\n本人愿赌服输，自愿在未来任意一天的任意时刻，无条件响应佩吉公主的召唤，并担任其专属跟班一日。\n跟班职责包括但不限于：\n拎包（限重10公斤以内）。\n买单（仅限合理的金额和商品范围内）。\n在佩吉公主需要的时候，大声赞美她的智慧与美貌（可以违心地说）。\n特此立据，绝不赖账！\n<align=\"right\">欠债人：罗万（颤抖的签名）\n<align=\"right\">债权人：佩吉（得意洋洋的签名）","textdes_id":"551","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"契约书","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"7802024","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item4.png","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item4.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"false"},"say:12:1720711008:1":{"key":"say:12:1720711008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1720711008","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"白纸黑字，罗万少爷，今天你是我的跟班了！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:13:1720711009:1":{"key":"say:13:1720711009:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"13","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1720711009","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"……啧，失策了。当初就不应该签这个不平等条约。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","docum